msgid "DOMPurify Library"
msgstr "DOMPurify நூலகம்"

msgid "DOMPurify library"
msgstr "DOMPurify நூலகம்"

msgid "DOMPurify is already present at @path. No download required."
msgstr ""
"DOMPurify ஏற்கனவே @path இல் உள்ளது. "
"பதிவிறக்கம் தேவையில்லை."

msgid ""
